WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:05.451
Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org

00:00:11.669 --> 00:00:21.664
♪In ancient times, a meteor fell♪

00:00:22.528 --> 00:00:29.920
♪Scorching Nanba Weald into land bare♪

00:00:30.336 --> 00:00:39.993
♪From Turquoise Land beneath the sun♪

00:00:41.088 --> 00:00:52.256
♪The evil Earth Fiends were born♪

00:00:55.168 --> 00:00:58.400
♪Marching in South Mountain's domain♪

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:01.248
♪Sworn warriors raged for glory's gain♪

00:01:01.248 --> 00:01:03.328
♪Renamed guardians hold Yanguan true♪

00:01:03.328 --> 00:01:06.656
♪Peace in all lands, a priceless boon♪

00:01:12.224 --> 00:01:15.264
♪Seven hounds, two whips, one blade♪

00:01:15.264 --> 00:01:18.048
♪In rout and flight,
Earth Fiends escape♪

00:01:18.048 --> 00:01:20.839
♪Golden Gate seals fast♪

00:01:20.872 --> 00:01:25.243
♪South Mountain Hunters
on the righteous path♪

00:01:26.752 --> 00:01:37.024
♪South Mountain Hunters
on the righteous path♪

00:01:37.024 --> 00:01:41.216
=Love on the Turquoise Land=

00:01:41.216 --> 00:01:44.000
(This story is a work of fiction)

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:46.960
=Episode 8=

00:01:57.284 --> 00:01:58.004
Then,

00:01:58.644 --> 00:01:59.323
goodbye.

00:02:00.924 --> 00:02:02.404
We're unlikely to meet again.

00:02:06.963 --> 00:02:09.043
If you want to thank me
for saving your life,

00:02:09.124 --> 00:02:10.603
promise me two things.

00:02:11.723 --> 00:02:12.404
Go ahead.

00:02:13.804 --> 00:02:14.763
No matter

00:02:15.643 --> 00:02:17.323
who asks about recent events,

00:02:17.323 --> 00:02:18.483
never mention me.

00:02:19.483 --> 00:02:20.684
I want no more ties

00:02:20.684 --> 00:02:22.364
to South Mountain Hunters
or Earth Fiends.

00:02:24.483 --> 00:02:25.284
And second?

00:02:28.244 --> 00:02:30.163
The South Mountain Hunters have chosen

00:02:30.203 --> 00:02:31.524
a difficult yet righteous path.

00:02:32.923 --> 00:02:34.524
Though I'm not in a position to judge,

00:02:35.323 --> 00:02:36.084
I still hope

00:02:36.084 --> 00:02:37.603
you'll keep cooperating with them.

00:02:38.364 --> 00:02:39.763
This could be your chance

00:02:40.923 --> 00:02:42.443
to avenge your mother

00:02:43.323 --> 00:02:44.723
and find your sister.

00:02:46.763 --> 00:02:47.923
If you agree,

00:02:48.323 --> 00:02:49.524
I can help arrange contact.

00:02:51.364 --> 00:02:51.964
Deal.

00:03:23.564 --> 00:03:24.284
You actually

00:03:24.964 --> 00:03:27.323
do have some redeeming qualities.

00:03:31.483 --> 00:03:32.524
After all this time,

00:03:33.203 --> 00:03:34.163
it's the highest praise

00:03:34.163 --> 00:03:35.524
I've ever gotten from you.

00:03:48.284 --> 00:03:49.163
Miss Nie.

00:03:51.163 --> 00:03:52.483
You're finally back.

00:03:54.004 --> 00:03:54.832
What's for the meal?

00:03:55.923 --> 00:03:56.964
Whatever you make is fine.

00:03:57.923 --> 00:03:58.603
Let me help.

00:03:58.603 --> 00:03:59.163
No need.

00:03:59.323 --> 00:04:00.723
I can handle it myself.

00:04:35.536 --> 00:04:39.248
(Nie Jiuluo)

00:05:36.643 --> 00:05:37.804
The long blade dispels life.

00:05:39.044 --> 00:05:40.164
The short one pursues death.

00:05:41.364 --> 00:05:42.164
Luo,

00:05:44.724 --> 00:05:45.924
with the Life-Death Blade,

00:05:47.244 --> 00:05:48.564
you are Mad Blade.

00:06:59.203 --> 00:07:01.044
Miss Nie, you should rest.

00:07:01.203 --> 00:07:02.963
I'll make soup dumplings quickly.

00:07:03.124 --> 00:07:04.244
Let me help.

00:07:04.523 --> 00:07:05.724
No need to trouble yourself.

00:07:06.484 --> 00:07:08.604
It's okay. I'm just idling anyway.

00:07:11.604 --> 00:07:13.724
Weren't you supposed to help Mom?

00:07:13.963 --> 00:07:15.484
Why are you crafting alone?

00:07:18.883 --> 00:07:20.604
Luo, this is the last one.

00:07:20.883 --> 00:07:22.124
We can't waste food.

00:07:22.883 --> 00:07:24.564
See how skillful our daughter is.

00:07:29.523 --> 00:07:30.523
Keep praising her.

00:07:30.523 --> 00:07:31.564
We'll run out of dough.

00:07:31.643 --> 00:07:32.564
This is on you.

00:07:33.083 --> 00:07:33.843
So what?

00:07:34.323 --> 00:07:35.804
We can turn the rest of the filling

00:07:36.484 --> 00:07:37.164
into meatballs.

00:07:40.604 --> 00:07:41.443
Press here.

00:07:43.763 --> 00:07:44.523
Spin faster.

00:07:44.523 --> 00:07:45.283
Your method...

00:07:46.124 --> 00:07:46.843
isn't working.

00:07:52.484 --> 00:07:55.164
You remembered something happy?

00:08:02.684 --> 00:08:03.484
Nothing.

00:08:04.203 --> 00:08:06.484
Just feels nice like this.

00:08:08.484 --> 00:08:09.443
That's good.

00:08:10.124 --> 00:08:11.083
Then in the future,

00:08:11.083 --> 00:08:12.763
stop wandering off so often.

00:08:12.924 --> 00:08:13.763
Come home more.

00:08:14.164 --> 00:08:15.484
No place compares to home.

00:08:32.283 --> 00:08:33.084
You...

00:08:33.163 --> 00:08:34.604
I didn't let you in.

00:08:35.643 --> 00:08:36.484
Miss Nie.

00:08:39.763 --> 00:08:41.283
It's okay, Ms. Lu. He's my friend.

00:08:41.484 --> 00:08:42.163
You can go.

00:08:43.364 --> 00:08:44.004
Alright.

00:08:48.643 --> 00:08:49.683
Jiang's in trouble.

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:16.016
(Massage, Foot Spa, Wellness)

00:09:16.016 --> 00:09:18.046
(Nutritious Breakfast)

00:09:19.728 --> 00:09:21.084
(Free Checkups)

00:09:21.084 --> 00:09:22.923
Keep it dry. Avoid irritants.

00:09:22.923 --> 00:09:24.283
I shouldn't need to remind you.

00:09:24.403 --> 00:09:26.160
Return in three days
for a dressing change.

00:09:26.324 --> 00:09:26.844
Got it.

00:09:27.364 --> 00:09:28.923
You're practically a doctor by now.

00:09:28.923 --> 00:09:29.883
So no need to return.

00:09:30.124 --> 00:09:31.364
Buy gauze and do it yourself.

00:09:32.204 --> 00:09:33.283
Say hi to Xiong.

00:09:33.563 --> 00:09:34.724
- Okay.
- Okay.

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:46.512
(Massage)

00:09:58.604 --> 00:09:59.523
What?

00:09:59.763 --> 00:10:00.763
Forget something?

00:10:03.484 --> 00:10:05.563
Can't you read 'Closed'?

00:10:16.163 --> 00:10:19.124
Front shop, back clinic.
This is shady business.

00:10:19.883 --> 00:10:21.043
Don't say that.

00:10:21.563 --> 00:10:23.043
If the Dragon King needs a jade bed,

00:10:23.163 --> 00:10:24.643
Xicang's Wanbao Tower has it.

00:10:25.244 --> 00:10:26.324
My dream was to open

00:10:26.724 --> 00:10:29.204
an East-meets-West place

00:10:30.163 --> 00:10:31.403
where food is medicine.

00:10:31.604 --> 00:10:33.444
Whether you're injured

00:10:33.444 --> 00:10:34.643
or ill or something,

00:10:34.724 --> 00:10:36.244
you can find solutions here.

00:10:37.004 --> 00:10:37.964
What about Xiong Hei?

00:10:38.403 --> 00:10:39.444
What 'solutions' for them?

00:10:41.683 --> 00:10:42.964
Aren't they doing business?

00:10:43.964 --> 00:10:45.124
Working in all weathers,

00:10:45.244 --> 00:10:46.403
illnesses and ailments

00:10:47.043 --> 00:10:47.643
are normal.

00:10:50.204 --> 00:10:51.084
Seems like

00:10:51.563 --> 00:10:53.643
Ms. Lin hasn't funded
your education or business

00:10:53.643 --> 00:10:55.484
entirely for charity.

00:10:55.883 --> 00:10:57.163
You apply what you've learned.

00:11:02.124 --> 00:11:03.403
Aren't you from Roadsound too?

00:11:04.683 --> 00:11:05.364
What?

00:11:05.923 --> 00:11:07.763
Are you turning in your own?

00:11:10.163 --> 00:11:11.763
Now you accept me as your own?

00:11:12.004 --> 00:11:13.803
Weren't you guarding against me earlier?

00:11:19.964 --> 00:11:21.124
What do you want?

00:11:22.244 --> 00:11:23.124
What's with you?

00:11:24.004 --> 00:11:25.324
After all these years, what now?

00:11:25.403 --> 00:11:26.923
You came all this way to expose me?

00:11:30.403 --> 00:11:32.844
Fine. If you truly consider me your own,

00:11:34.604 --> 00:11:35.403
examine me.

00:11:41.484 --> 00:11:42.883
I got injured from a hiking fall.

00:11:50.964 --> 00:11:53.204
Yes. It doesn't look
like hiking injuries.

00:11:53.444 --> 00:11:54.204
No questions.

00:11:54.484 --> 00:11:55.724
Just find me a resting place.

00:11:59.683 --> 00:12:01.163
It's definitely from hiking.

00:12:02.043 --> 00:12:02.923
I can tell.

00:12:03.324 --> 00:12:03.923
Stop that.

00:12:04.484 --> 00:12:05.124
After you.

00:13:23.964 --> 00:13:25.403
Why did you leave Jiang here?

00:13:27.563 --> 00:13:28.883
It was urgent,

00:13:29.563 --> 00:13:30.803
and he insisted on staying.

00:13:31.444 --> 00:13:32.244
So I didn't argue...

00:13:32.244 --> 00:13:33.523
But you should've insisted too.

00:13:36.364 --> 00:13:37.204
I'm sorry, Luo.

00:13:38.043 --> 00:13:39.124
It's my mistake.

00:13:56.084 --> 00:13:56.883
If

00:13:58.124 --> 00:13:59.283
I had stayed to cover

00:14:00.883 --> 00:14:02.244
and gotten captured instead,

00:14:05.043 --> 00:14:06.444
would you be blaming Jiang

00:14:07.563 --> 00:14:08.683
the way you are now?

00:14:47.004 --> 00:14:47.923
Laobanzhang Tea,

00:14:48.763 --> 00:14:49.604
an ancient tree tea.

00:14:58.484 --> 00:14:59.163
You people

00:15:00.563 --> 00:15:01.364
know tea?

00:15:02.724 --> 00:15:04.403
With millennia of tea culture,

00:15:04.763 --> 00:15:07.004
we newcomers wouldn't claim expertise.

00:15:08.084 --> 00:15:09.604
Yet you presume mastery.

00:15:10.124 --> 00:15:11.444
With history merely a blink

00:15:11.643 --> 00:15:14.004
in the eyes of heaven and earth,

00:15:14.724 --> 00:15:17.124
how dare you pose as nature's overlords?

00:15:20.844 --> 00:15:22.803
Arrogance didn't bring humanity

00:15:22.803 --> 00:15:23.844
to its current state.

00:15:25.283 --> 00:15:27.364
Most of our progress

00:15:27.763 --> 00:15:30.803
comes from exploration, curiosity,

00:15:31.004 --> 00:15:32.283
and constant error correction,

00:15:32.283 --> 00:15:32.844
and yes,

00:15:34.324 --> 00:15:35.283
some luck.

00:15:36.324 --> 00:15:37.964
That's how we've achieved this.

00:15:38.364 --> 00:15:39.484
If you just imitate us

00:15:39.763 --> 00:15:42.964
without understanding,

00:15:44.563 --> 00:15:46.204
you'll stumble through endless detours.

00:15:48.523 --> 00:15:51.724
So how did
the South Mountain Hunters decline

00:15:52.124 --> 00:15:53.004
to this state?

00:15:53.844 --> 00:15:54.604
Underestimation?

00:15:55.364 --> 00:15:56.043
Complacency?

00:15:56.084 --> 00:15:57.283
Or fractured organization?

00:16:01.324 --> 00:16:03.643
Once the Blade, Hound, and Whip clans

00:16:03.643 --> 00:16:05.563
worked seamlessly together.

00:16:05.964 --> 00:16:08.324
Yet this time,

00:16:09.004 --> 00:16:11.124
only Mad Dog fought seriously.

00:16:12.364 --> 00:16:15.444
When will we see the Whip Clan

00:16:16.523 --> 00:16:17.883
and Blade Clan's prowess?

00:16:25.643 --> 00:16:26.683
Do you feel sorry?

00:16:31.724 --> 00:16:33.004
I'd say

00:16:33.484 --> 00:16:34.803
you should be grateful.

00:16:35.803 --> 00:16:38.324
Had you encountered all three,
Ghost Whip,

00:16:38.844 --> 00:16:39.523
Mad Dog,

00:16:40.043 --> 00:16:40.883
and Mad Blade,

00:16:41.964 --> 00:16:43.484
you wouldn't live to see the sun.

00:16:43.604 --> 00:16:44.724
No need to summon them.

00:16:45.283 --> 00:16:47.004
I'll visit them myself.

00:16:47.163 --> 00:16:49.244
So Mr. Jiang,

00:16:49.883 --> 00:16:52.283
please reveal Mad Blade's identity.

00:16:53.643 --> 00:16:55.084
Or you won't live to see

00:16:55.084 --> 00:16:56.604
tonight's moon.

00:17:00.084 --> 00:17:02.163
So this tea meeting is about this?

00:17:03.043 --> 00:17:04.123
Should've said so earlier.

00:17:06.523 --> 00:17:08.283
Our generation's Mad Blade
was Old Blade.

00:17:08.884 --> 00:17:10.323
You've already fought him.

00:17:12.164 --> 00:17:12.684
He was

00:17:13.884 --> 00:17:15.123
badly wounded by him.

00:17:18.763 --> 00:17:19.404
Old Blade!

00:17:54.083 --> 00:17:54.884
Sir?

00:17:54.884 --> 00:17:56.204
What's happening, sir?

00:17:57.164 --> 00:17:58.083
Where are we going?

00:18:00.323 --> 00:18:01.004
Sir?

00:18:04.523 --> 00:18:05.204
Jiang?

00:18:07.724 --> 00:18:08.523
You ask me?

00:18:09.244 --> 00:18:10.924
I should be questioning you.

00:18:11.884 --> 00:18:13.283
Will you rescue me

00:18:14.283 --> 00:18:15.283
and my brothers or not?

00:18:31.843 --> 00:18:34.843
Jiang! Jiang!

00:18:38.164 --> 00:18:38.884
Jiang!

00:18:52.404 --> 00:18:53.484
Sir,

00:18:54.363 --> 00:18:55.843
I want to change the destination.

00:18:56.043 --> 00:18:57.884
The meter's running. It's up to you.

00:18:59.724 --> 00:19:01.924
I'm going to South Mountain.
It might be a bit far.

00:19:03.363 --> 00:19:05.283
Anywhere within the province is fine.

00:19:14.444 --> 00:19:15.964
You risked your life

00:19:15.964 --> 00:19:17.884
covering your team's retreat.

00:19:18.244 --> 00:19:19.964
Now you're suddenly being candid?

00:19:20.763 --> 00:19:21.843
How can I trust you?

00:19:39.244 --> 00:19:39.924
I

00:19:42.763 --> 00:19:44.004
am in your custody now.

00:19:44.964 --> 00:19:46.684
And we've lost Mad Blade
as our trump card.

00:19:47.204 --> 00:19:49.603
There's no reason for me
to bluff with you.

00:19:55.644 --> 00:19:56.444
Maybe...

00:19:57.843 --> 00:19:59.444
maybe it's just as you said.

00:20:00.563 --> 00:20:02.644
The South Mountain Hunters
declined to this state

00:20:03.083 --> 00:20:04.843
because of underestimation, complacency,

00:20:06.283 --> 00:20:07.563
and fractured organization.

00:20:10.964 --> 00:20:12.283
Moreover, my candor

00:20:12.644 --> 00:20:15.123
is meant to secure
my companions' freedom.

00:20:19.244 --> 00:20:21.123
They have their own lives to live.

00:20:21.884 --> 00:20:23.523
For them, being South Mountain Hunters

00:20:24.123 --> 00:20:25.404
is just a job,

00:20:26.283 --> 00:20:27.204
not a calling.

00:20:42.352 --> 00:20:45.712
(Rare Stone Garden)

00:20:51.244 --> 00:20:53.523
I haven't seen Yan Tuo
these past few days.

00:21:00.083 --> 00:21:00.763
"Xiong,

00:21:01.204 --> 00:21:03.363
I met this girl recently.

00:21:03.644 --> 00:21:04.684
Feisty one.

00:21:05.043 --> 00:21:06.964
I'm taking her hiking
for a couple of days.

00:21:07.523 --> 00:21:08.924
If Ms. Lin asks,

00:21:09.043 --> 00:21:10.523
cover for me.

00:21:10.724 --> 00:21:12.363
Say I'm on a business trip."

00:21:17.968 --> 00:21:20.194
(Design of a Bionic Fire-Fighting Robot)

00:21:20.624 --> 00:21:26.832
(Xicang's Nanshan Rescue Team's
Charity Efforts)

00:21:34.043 --> 00:21:36.323
First Mrs. Hua was seriously injured.

00:21:37.004 --> 00:21:38.404
Then Mr. Crip.

00:21:41.884 --> 00:21:44.043
Now even Jiang's been captured.

00:21:44.444 --> 00:21:45.803
South Mountain Hunters?

00:21:47.204 --> 00:21:48.563
More like South Mountain prey.

00:21:50.523 --> 00:21:51.884
Enough talk.

00:21:54.283 --> 00:21:56.204
I'll pull seniority to speak first.

00:21:57.244 --> 00:21:58.363
With Baichuan gone,

00:21:58.363 --> 00:21:59.644
we can't remain leaderless.

00:22:00.164 --> 00:22:01.164
The priority

00:22:01.444 --> 00:22:02.724
is finding someone to lead.

00:22:03.603 --> 00:22:04.444
That should be you.

00:22:04.724 --> 00:22:06.283
You're the most senior and respected.

00:22:06.724 --> 00:22:07.444
Right, Mr. Crip.

00:22:07.924 --> 00:22:08.884
You should lead us.

00:22:09.083 --> 00:22:10.043
We'd all follow.

00:22:11.164 --> 00:22:12.244
If I lead,

00:22:12.684 --> 00:22:14.323
I won't let us be humiliated like this.

00:22:14.644 --> 00:22:16.204
Those inhuman beings,

00:22:16.204 --> 00:22:17.283
every last one of them,

00:22:17.644 --> 00:22:18.684
will be wiped out.

00:22:18.724 --> 00:22:19.924
We'll rescue Baichuan.

00:22:20.123 --> 00:22:22.043
- Great!
- Great!

00:22:24.603 --> 00:22:25.204
Great?

00:22:27.244 --> 00:22:28.763
Who attacked us?

00:22:29.724 --> 00:22:30.603
Who are they?

00:22:30.684 --> 00:22:31.484
Where are they now?

00:22:31.523 --> 00:22:32.244
Do you know?

00:22:32.924 --> 00:22:33.884
And

00:22:34.563 --> 00:22:36.363
which direction should we investigate?

00:22:43.843 --> 00:22:45.004
At my age,

00:22:46.004 --> 00:22:47.803
I know my limitations.

00:22:48.603 --> 00:22:50.684
I'm more temper than talent.

00:22:51.404 --> 00:22:52.363
In real crises,

00:22:52.724 --> 00:22:55.283
I might not stay calm
like you youngsters.

00:22:56.083 --> 00:22:57.363
So I can't lead.

00:22:58.964 --> 00:23:00.123
But if you

00:23:00.244 --> 00:23:01.803
truly respect me as your elder,

00:23:03.083 --> 00:23:04.004
I'll name someone.

00:23:19.563 --> 00:23:20.484
Xing Shen

00:23:20.884 --> 00:23:22.283
has lived here for years

00:23:23.603 --> 00:23:25.603
and knows South Mountain
better than any of us.

00:23:26.363 --> 00:23:27.843
I watched him grow up.

00:23:28.444 --> 00:23:29.563
Everything he does

00:23:30.004 --> 00:23:32.004
prioritizes the Hunters' interests

00:23:32.004 --> 00:23:33.004
above all else.

00:23:34.724 --> 00:23:36.763
With Mad Blade and Ghost Whip gone,

00:23:37.563 --> 00:23:39.563
Mad Dog should naturally lead.

00:23:41.204 --> 00:23:43.004
Someone who kept an Earth Fiend
leading us?

00:23:43.724 --> 00:23:45.283
It's like a rat among the cats' ranks.

00:23:45.763 --> 00:23:46.763
I don't know about you,

00:23:47.083 --> 00:23:48.083
but this disgusts me.

00:23:48.484 --> 00:23:49.323
About that matter,

00:23:49.484 --> 00:23:51.043
Jiang already concluded it

00:23:51.043 --> 00:23:52.164
with proper resolution.

00:23:52.843 --> 00:23:55.043
Hadn't that Earth Fiend
appeared that day,

00:23:55.563 --> 00:23:56.803
disrupting the enemy's plans,

00:23:57.244 --> 00:23:58.724
we'd have suffered heavier losses.

00:23:58.843 --> 00:24:00.244
Since when did that fiend help?

00:24:00.323 --> 00:24:00.884
Exactly.

00:24:00.884 --> 00:24:01.644
I think...

00:24:02.404 --> 00:24:03.603
We need long-term planning.

00:24:03.603 --> 00:24:04.924
Enough arguing.

00:24:12.884 --> 00:24:13.843
Let's vote then.

00:24:16.523 --> 00:24:19.603
I agree Xing Shen
should lead temporarily.

00:24:20.004 --> 00:24:20.884
Show of hands.

00:24:37.843 --> 00:24:39.763
Shen will help us all.

00:24:41.763 --> 00:24:43.204
Ma trusts him.

00:24:43.644 --> 00:24:44.803
Ma trusts in Shen.

00:24:47.123 --> 00:24:47.924
In the past,

00:24:49.724 --> 00:24:51.803
Mom trusted Shen too.

00:25:18.724 --> 00:25:21.404
The ink line on wood becomes the rule.

00:25:21.924 --> 00:25:22.964
It's majority support.

00:25:23.323 --> 00:25:23.803
Done.

00:25:28.004 --> 00:25:29.484
South Mountain is in your hands now.

00:25:33.644 --> 00:25:34.803
Don't let me down.

00:26:09.043 --> 00:26:10.404
Thank you for your trust.

00:26:11.244 --> 00:26:12.323
I'll

00:26:13.363 --> 00:26:15.484
temporarily take Jiang's position.

00:26:16.043 --> 00:26:18.603
I've contacted Ghost Whip and Mad Blade.

00:26:19.404 --> 00:26:21.043
They've confirmed participation.

00:26:22.724 --> 00:26:24.444
With unity,

00:26:24.803 --> 00:26:26.803
we'll rescue Jiang quickly.

00:26:27.763 --> 00:26:28.724
Ghost Whip is one thing,

00:26:28.724 --> 00:26:29.444
but Mad Blade

00:26:30.164 --> 00:26:32.484
was difficult even when Jiang led us.

00:26:33.004 --> 00:26:33.964
Will she come?

00:26:35.043 --> 00:26:35.644
Right.

00:26:39.244 --> 00:26:40.004
She will.

00:26:45.763 --> 00:26:46.763
It's fine.

00:26:47.004 --> 00:26:48.123
Don't worry.

00:26:49.603 --> 00:26:51.083
You've worked hard these years.

00:26:52.283 --> 00:26:53.404
Spend time with family.

00:26:54.724 --> 00:26:55.924
In these peaceful times,

00:26:56.004 --> 00:26:57.123
what could go wrong?

00:26:57.323 --> 00:26:57.924
Right?

00:26:58.323 --> 00:26:59.484
Even if trouble comes,

00:26:59.724 --> 00:27:01.964
Banya Mountain and Qiaotou Gully

00:27:02.444 --> 00:27:04.603
have sent reinforcements recently.

00:27:05.803 --> 00:27:07.603
You just rest another fortnight.

00:27:08.123 --> 00:27:08.964
We got this.

00:27:10.763 --> 00:27:11.803
No need.

00:27:12.724 --> 00:27:14.684
I just check on the mountains
once in a while.

00:27:15.563 --> 00:27:16.363
Stop worrying.

00:27:18.603 --> 00:27:19.843
Alright, it's settled then.

00:27:20.004 --> 00:27:20.603
I need to go.

00:27:25.523 --> 00:27:27.164
Why not recruit your team

00:27:27.563 --> 00:27:28.884
to join us?

00:27:29.924 --> 00:27:31.523
At least we'd look formidable.

00:27:32.123 --> 00:27:33.444
Might scare others.

00:27:38.363 --> 00:27:39.684
Can't even shut you up with food?

00:27:41.964 --> 00:27:43.763
'Peaceful times'?

00:27:44.444 --> 00:27:45.123
What's wrong?

00:27:45.283 --> 00:27:47.083
Having food is peace.

00:27:48.763 --> 00:27:50.763
But some can't eat anymore.

00:27:51.884 --> 00:27:53.843
Sun Zhou is starving himself.

00:27:54.763 --> 00:27:55.283
Really?

00:27:57.043 --> 00:27:58.083
He's been refusing meals,

00:27:58.083 --> 00:28:00.004
saying cooked food disgusts him.

00:28:00.283 --> 00:28:01.763
I think it's time.

00:28:04.043 --> 00:28:05.763
I need to check on him.

00:28:06.244 --> 00:28:07.763
We already have one Earth Fiend.

00:28:07.924 --> 00:28:10.004
Can't handle another biter.

00:29:14.644 --> 00:29:15.444
Today,

00:29:19.283 --> 00:29:20.363
I spoke harshly.

00:29:20.363 --> 00:29:22.083
I should've stayed behind

00:29:23.404 --> 00:29:25.323
instead of letting Jiang take the risk.

00:29:31.803 --> 00:29:33.164
No one expected

00:29:33.684 --> 00:29:34.763
that situation.

00:29:35.283 --> 00:29:36.244
It's not your fault.

00:29:38.884 --> 00:29:40.083
Besides apologizing,

00:29:41.164 --> 00:29:42.323
I want to say

00:29:43.684 --> 00:29:44.724
I have a friend

00:29:45.484 --> 00:29:47.164
who might help rescue Jiang.

00:29:48.283 --> 00:29:49.083
But

00:29:50.924 --> 00:29:52.004
it's risky.

00:29:54.164 --> 00:29:54.843
A friend?

00:29:56.004 --> 00:29:57.244
Sun Zhou's gone!

00:29:57.684 --> 00:29:58.924
Sun Zhou's gone!

00:30:21.484 --> 00:30:22.484
All this time,

00:30:22.684 --> 00:30:23.924
Sun Zhou has been locked up?

00:30:26.563 --> 00:30:28.283
He has red threads through his pupils.

00:30:29.523 --> 00:30:31.404
We should've sent him to Golden Gate,

00:30:32.123 --> 00:30:33.603
but Jiang stopped us.

00:30:38.563 --> 00:30:40.924
I begged Jiang to save him.

00:30:45.444 --> 00:30:46.884
You're too softhearted.

00:30:48.523 --> 00:30:50.043
It's South Mountain Hunters' duty

00:30:50.404 --> 00:30:51.563
to protect civilians

00:30:51.563 --> 00:30:52.684
from Earth Fiends.

00:30:53.363 --> 00:30:54.523
How's that softhearted?

00:30:58.083 --> 00:31:00.043
We called you 'Nine Oxen' as kids.

00:31:00.763 --> 00:31:01.523
Do you remember?

00:31:06.803 --> 00:31:07.803
I'd forgotten.

00:31:09.563 --> 00:31:10.684
Jiang said

00:31:11.444 --> 00:31:13.004
you seem obedient,

00:31:14.283 --> 00:31:15.603
yet stand firmest.

00:31:17.043 --> 00:31:18.004
Not even nine oxen

00:31:19.363 --> 00:31:20.684
can turn you from your course.

00:31:23.563 --> 00:31:24.404
If we delay,

00:31:24.684 --> 00:31:26.043
even nine horses won't catch him.

00:31:26.644 --> 00:31:27.244
Sit tight.

00:31:35.843 --> 00:31:37.323
How'd you track Sun Zhou?

00:31:37.644 --> 00:31:38.924
He stole Big Head's phone

00:31:38.924 --> 00:31:40.244
while escaping.

00:31:41.164 --> 00:31:42.244
It has GPS.

00:31:43.763 --> 00:31:45.523
Jiang's phone doesn't?

00:31:47.123 --> 00:31:48.363
Big Head uses the rescue team's

00:31:48.363 --> 00:31:49.684
dedicated tracking system.

00:31:54.123 --> 00:31:55.404
Maybe we didn't need it before.

00:31:56.684 --> 00:31:58.843
Let's get everyone equipped
in the future.

00:32:03.083 --> 00:32:04.404
Given his movement speed,

00:32:04.803 --> 00:32:05.763
let's go faster.

00:32:34.123 --> 00:32:35.043
I'm back.

00:32:37.644 --> 00:32:38.763
It's too remote here.

00:32:39.283 --> 00:32:40.563
This was all I could get.

00:32:41.244 --> 00:32:43.644
Make do with this for now.

00:32:48.523 --> 00:32:49.244
(Cang Water)
Have some water.

00:32:55.924 --> 00:32:56.724
What are you doing?

00:33:05.523 --> 00:33:06.484
Are you in trouble?

00:33:07.563 --> 00:33:10.444
You came alone to this wilderness,

00:33:11.484 --> 00:33:13.404
saying you were hiding at your uncle's.

00:33:19.204 --> 00:33:20.283
Let me go.

00:33:21.563 --> 00:33:22.684
I'll get mad.

00:33:42.244 --> 00:33:43.204
Let me go.

00:34:36.243 --> 00:34:38.163
She's fine, no bites.

00:34:38.243 --> 00:34:39.312
I'll get her to hospital.

00:34:40.844 --> 00:34:42.163
I'll take Sun Zhou back then.

00:34:43.804 --> 00:34:45.523
He's innocent.
He just got dragged into it.

00:34:46.243 --> 00:34:47.163
Try to help him.

00:34:50.083 --> 00:34:50.844
I will.

00:36:43.964 --> 00:36:45.924
(Nie Jiuluo: 9:00, Spring Return Road)

00:36:51.203 --> 00:36:54.243
(Just saw it. On my way now,)

00:36:54.243 --> 00:36:56.563
(but I'll be a few minutes late.)

00:37:08.804 --> 00:37:09.643
Miss Nie,

00:37:09.643 --> 00:37:11.083
breakfast will be ready soon.

00:37:12.163 --> 00:37:12.884
Miss Nie?

00:37:13.243 --> 00:37:14.203
Ms. Lu, you have it.

00:37:14.203 --> 00:37:15.163
I need to go out.

00:37:15.324 --> 00:37:17.083
Leaving again right after coming back?

00:37:18.364 --> 00:37:20.043
Don't young people today ever sleep?

00:37:35.444 --> 00:37:36.203
He left so early?

00:37:38.444 --> 00:37:39.764
Do you want me to call and check?

00:37:41.804 --> 00:37:42.924
Leave him for now.

00:38:15.324 --> 00:38:17.683
No beating around the bush today, okay?

00:38:22.563 --> 00:38:23.404
You look exhausted.

00:38:23.643 --> 00:38:25.004
Skip the formalities too.

00:38:25.364 --> 00:38:26.203
No small talk.

00:38:27.484 --> 00:38:28.563
Alright, go ahead.

00:38:31.563 --> 00:38:34.284
Someone named Jiang Baichuan
was captured by Lin Xirou.

00:38:35.203 --> 00:38:37.043
He's crucial
to the South Mountain Hunters.

00:38:37.404 --> 00:38:38.723
And to me too.

00:38:39.643 --> 00:38:41.123
I hope you can help me rescue him.

00:38:41.924 --> 00:38:42.523
Of course,

00:38:42.523 --> 00:38:43.884
you might not be able to help.

00:38:43.884 --> 00:38:45.163
Okay, I'll help you.

00:38:46.683 --> 00:38:47.364
You will?

00:38:48.683 --> 00:38:49.444
So straightforward?

00:38:50.563 --> 00:38:51.563
Wasn't it you who said,

00:38:51.563 --> 00:38:53.123
'No beating around the bush'?

00:38:56.683 --> 00:38:57.683
I did say that.

00:38:57.924 --> 00:38:59.203
But you didn't ask anything.

00:38:59.804 --> 00:39:00.683
Isn't that rash?

00:39:02.324 --> 00:39:03.484
You contacted me proactively.

00:39:03.563 --> 00:39:05.404
It shows the situation is urgent.

00:39:06.404 --> 00:39:07.964
You asked me for help.

00:39:07.964 --> 00:39:10.203
It means he's very important to you.

00:39:10.404 --> 00:39:11.844
If I help with this,

00:39:12.243 --> 00:39:13.364
at least I'll gain a chance

00:39:13.364 --> 00:39:14.404
to ask for your help.

00:39:15.804 --> 00:39:17.404
Moreover, if I successfully rescue him,

00:39:17.404 --> 00:39:19.364
you'll owe me a huge favor.

00:39:19.444 --> 00:39:20.484
Therefore,

00:39:20.484 --> 00:39:22.563
helping you
is my best option either way.

00:39:23.123 --> 00:39:24.444
Still think I'm being rash now?

00:39:25.203 --> 00:39:26.563
I won't owe you favors.

00:39:26.804 --> 00:39:27.683
I'll pay you.

00:39:34.163 --> 00:39:34.603
Wait,

00:39:35.083 --> 00:39:36.563
I'm helping you with a huge favor.

00:39:36.563 --> 00:39:37.804
And you brush me off with this?

00:39:59.664 --> 00:40:08.312
♪Your past shines brightly,
your path ahead wide and open♪

00:40:14.064 --> 00:40:15.360
When I trained as a kid,

00:40:16.520 --> 00:40:18.360
Mr. Crip always said,

00:40:19.440 --> 00:40:20.720
"Own your mistakes.

00:40:21.880 --> 00:40:23.320
Stand straight when punished."

00:40:25.080 --> 00:40:26.120
Same goes for you.

00:40:28.200 --> 00:40:29.760
Once you enter South Mountain,

00:40:30.600 --> 00:40:32.160
you'll follow our rules.

00:40:34.200 --> 00:40:36.440
I don't know how long you'll stay here.

00:40:38.720 --> 00:40:40.960
I've tried my best.

00:40:42.840 --> 00:40:47.320
If the Hunters still reject you,

00:40:48.960 --> 00:40:50.800
there's nothing else I can do.

00:40:54.288 --> 00:40:58.488
♪Ripping apart the hidden truth
beneath the surface♪

00:40:58.488 --> 00:41:02.848
♪Heaven-sent tides can't
drown this stubborn flame♪

00:41:02.920 --> 00:41:10.688
♪Farewell to the old times,
and scenes fade away one by one♪

00:41:13.240 --> 00:41:14.000
Don't blame me,

00:41:16.600 --> 00:41:17.360
Locust.

00:41:30.208 --> 00:41:34.568
♪The shapeless fire
clings to matter to illuminate♪

00:41:34.568 --> 00:41:38.888
♪Yet malice in darkness
defies the flame's pursuit♪

00:41:38.888 --> 00:41:43.328
♪A noble name must do righteous deeds♪

00:41:43.328 --> 00:41:45.768
♪After sunrise,
even wise words falter in truth♪

00:41:45.768 --> 00:41:49.848
♪Heaven-forged fire
scorches flesh and bone♪

00:41:49.848 --> 00:41:54.208
♪Dig out the truth buried
beneath the earth♪

00:41:54.208 --> 00:41:58.568
♪Heaven-sent tides can't
quench this reckless fire♪

00:41:58.568 --> 00:42:02.928
♪If we don't retreat,
we'll go through it together♪

00:42:02.928 --> 00:42:07.288
♪Heaven-kindled flames are different♪

00:42:07.288 --> 00:42:11.568
♪Truth's madness is hiding
under the surface♪

00:42:11.568 --> 00:42:16.128
♪The large waves are rolling
towards the sky♪

00:42:16.128 --> 00:42:23.848
♪Farewell to the old times,
and scenes fade away one by one♪